## Architecture Overview

This project follows the **Hexagonal Architecture** (Clean Architecture) principles to ensure business logic is decoupled from technical details.

```mermaid
graph TD
    Web[Web / FastAPI Routers] --> UseCases[Application Use Cases]
    UseCases -- Calls --> Ports[Ports / ABC Interfaces]
    Ports -- Implemented by --> Adapters[Infrastructure / SQLAlchemy]
    UseCases -- Operates on --> Entities[Domain Entities / Dataclasses]
```

### Directory Structure

- `src/domain`: Pure business logic. Entities are Vanilla Python dataclasses.
- `src/application`: Orchestration logic. 
    - `use_cases`: Business actions.
    - `ports`: Abstract Base Classes (ABCs) defining the contracts.
- `src/infrastructure`: Technical details.
    - `repositories`: SQLAlchemy implementations of the Ports.
    - `persistence`: Database setup and ORM models.
- `src/web`: FastAPI routers and Pydantic DTOs.

## Getting Started

### 1. Installation
```bash
pip install -e ".[test]"
```

### 2. Run Tests (85% Coverage Required)
```bash
pytest
```

### 3. Run Development Server
```bash
uvicorn main:app --reload
```

